{
  "_comment": [
    "The copyleft each prebuilt pack carries, per platform, and the name the",
    "README gives each package. scripts/ci/third-party.py fails a build whose",
    "pack carries a package or component whose declared licence is GPL (or",
    "AGPL), GPL-or-other, GPL with the GCC runtime exception, LGPL, MPL, EPL",
    "or CDDL that is not listed here for that pack's platform (and warns of",
    "a listed one the pack does not carry). t/12-disclosure fails unless the",
    "README and doc/Readme.rakudoc name every listed package, under the",
    "disclosure item of 'Binary distributions and licensing' whose label",
    "names the platform's 'readme' label. Keys under 'packages' are conda",
    "package names (macOS, Linux) or build-win64-mxe component names, as",
    "third-party.py attributes files to them (Windows). A package whose",
    "declared licence is not copyleft, but which carries copyleft code, is",
    "listed by hand, since third-party.py cannot see it: libpsl declares",
    "MIT, and conda-forge builds it with the MPL-2.0 Public Suffix List",
    "compiled in (-Dbuiltin=true)."
  ],
